\n3169:                              (app* 'php/scope-release! (u/v '%scope))\n3199:               (u/let1 '%scope\n3205:                                                      (app* 'php/scope-adopt! (u/v '%scope) (u/lit (bare nm))\n3213:                                 (u/lam ['%x] (app* 'php/scope-release! (u/v '%scope))))\n3232:              (u/let1 '%cc (app* 'php/scope-of (u/v '%fn) (cc-node ctx)) wrapped)\n3295:                         (cc-node ctx)))]\n3329:              (app* 'php/new-finish (u/v o) (with-named-arg pos named) (cc-node ctx))))))\n3823:   variable scope, method context and safepoint hooks. It does not initialize\n3840:             (u/lam ['%runtime '%scope '%ctx '%hooks]\n3982:   definitions. The body is `(fn [%scope %ctx] <unit>)`: the including\n3988:              (u/def! 'body (u/lam ['%scope '%ctx] (unit-node ctx true)))]\n4106:                                    (u/lam ['%scope '%ctx]\ncat: test/yang/php/antlr/linked_harness.clj: No such file or directory\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
